      "content": "i get that, but it's like... if i'm the one carrying it all, maybe the only way to actually stop it from spreading is to just stop being a part of it. if the cycle only continues through me, then the only way to truly break the chain and protect the people coming after me is to make sure it ends right here. it feels like the only selfless thing left to do.",
